{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:1eff78abfc355d2c","name":"AV-1S Scout Armor","source":{"id":"source:reference-1eff78abfc355d2c","title":"AV-1S Scout Armor","revision":25281,"timestamp":"2024-11-15T13:17:21Z","sha256":"528fed5d157222e423a70e753134c225d9e3dbd46b66df0982053cb04cfab466","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=25281","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=AV-1S%20Scout%20Armor&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-1eff78abfc355d2c","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A scaled-down version of the GTU ",{"tag":"a","children":["AV-1C Combat Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/AV-1C_Combat_Armor","referenceId":"reference:8c84aedace5c6c60"},", the GTU AV-1S Scout Armor is lighter and allows for a greater degree of mobility, making it a favored suit for bounty hunters that rely on their speed and stealth to capture a mark. The AV-1S is also ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vacuum Sealed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vacuum_Sealed"}," and includes a built-in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Helmet Package"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Helmet_Package","referenceId":"reference:b06fc71b61b30f63"},", and a reduced-power repulsorlift system similar to the GTU ",{"tag":"a","children":["AV-1C Combat Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/AV-1C_Combat_Armor","referenceId":"reference:8c84aedace5c6c60"},". This repulsorlift functions as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jet Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jet_Pack","referenceId":"reference:a59ece57b04d9594"}," (following all the normal rules for the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jet Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jet_Pack","referenceId":"reference:a59ece57b04d9594"},") except that it produces no noise, heat, or flames, but grants a Fly Speed of only 4 squares instead of 6 squares. AV-1S Scout Armor is Powered Armor, giving it two free ",{"tag":"a","children":["Upgrade Slots"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Upgrade_Slots"},", and includes a built-in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Glow Rod"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Glow_Rod","referenceId":"reference:1c8b9eaebeec7318"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Medium Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Medium_Armor","referenceId":"reference:e2a45d7d144d40dd"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 15,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},":"]}," +7\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},":"]}," +2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Maximum ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," Bonus:"]}," +2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 18 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
